{"PageNumber":566,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":68,"SurahIndex":"068","VerseNumber":43,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"خَٰشِعَةً أَبۡصَٰرُهُمۡ تَرۡهَقُهُمۡ ذِلَّةٞۖ وَقَدۡ كَانُواْ يُدۡعَوۡنَ إِلَى ٱلسُّجُودِ وَهُمۡ سَٰلِمُونَ","TajweedText":"خَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>شِعَةً أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>صَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رُهُمْ تَرْهَقُهُمْ ذِلَّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةٌ‌ۖ و</tajweed>َقَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> كَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> يُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>عَوْنَ إِلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سُّجُودِ وَهُمْ سَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٣</span>","End":"٤٣","PageNumber":566,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":499,"MaqraNumber":226,"HizbNumber":57,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":68,"SurahIndex":"068","VerseNumber":44,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَذَرۡنِي وَمَن يُكَذِّبُ بِهَٰذَا ٱلۡحَدِيثِۖ سَنَسۡتَدۡرِجُهُم مِّنۡ حَيۡثُ لَا يَعۡلَمُونَ","TajweedText":"فَذَرْنِى وَم<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>ُكَذِّبُ بِهَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَدِيثِ‌ۖ سَنَسْتَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>رِجُه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنْ حَيْثُ لَا يَعْلَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٤</span>","End":"٤٤","PageNumber":566,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":499,"MaqraNumber":226,"HizbNumber":57,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":68,"SurahIndex":"068","VerseNumber":45,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأُمۡلِي لَهُمۡۚ إِنَّ كَيۡدِي مَتِينٌ","TajweedText":"وَأُمْلِى لَهُمْ‌ۚ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ كَيْدِى مَت<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٌ <span class=end>٤٥</span>","End":"٤٥","PageNumber":566,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":499,"MaqraNumber":226,"HizbNumber":57,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":68,"SurahIndex":"068","VerseNumber":46,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ تَسۡـَٔلُهُمۡ أَجۡرٗا فَهُم مِّن مَّغۡرَمٖ مُّثۡقَلُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ تَسْــَٔلُهُمْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>رًا ف</tajweed>َه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن م</tajweed>َّغْرَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مٍ م</tajweed>ُّثْقَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٦</span>","End":"٤٦","PageNumber":566,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":499,"MaqraNumber":226,"HizbNumber":57,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":68,"SurahIndex":"068","VerseNumber":47,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ عِندَهُمُ ٱلۡغَيۡبُ فَهُمۡ يَكۡتُبُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ عِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ند</tajweed>َهُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْغَيْبُ فَهُمْ يَكْتُب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٧</span>","End":"٤٧","PageNumber":566,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":499,"MaqraNumber":226,"HizbNumber":57,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":68,"SurahIndex":"068","VerseNumber":48,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَٱصۡبِرۡ لِحُكۡمِ رَبِّكَ وَلَا تَكُن كَصَاحِبِ ٱلۡحُوتِ إِذۡ نَادَىٰ وَهُوَ مَكۡظُومٞ","TajweedText":"فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>صْبِرْ لِحُكْمِ رَبِّكَ وَلَا تَكُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>َصَاحِبِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحُوتِ إِذْ نَادَىٰ وَهُوَ مَكْظ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>٤٨</span>","End":"٤٨","PageNumber":566,"JuzNumber":29,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":499,"MaqraNumber":226,"HizbNumber":57,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":68,"SurahIndex":"068","VerseNumber":49,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لَّوۡلَآ أَن تَدَٰرَك